# Clicking rows. Each REGEX is what a working click would open. This walk drives
# the terminal, which never turns on mouse reporting, so each click records "no effect".
start ^ Tonight
click Replays => ^ Replays: choose a sport
click Settings => ^ Settings
click Live TV => ^ Live TV
key s => ^ Live sports: choose a sport
click WNBA => ^ WNBA  \|
click Soccer: MLS => MLS  \|
